    title: "an io_primitives overlay may declare stdlib_other, which suppresses external_potential chains; overlays are stripped of stdlib_modules on purpose but not of this (ADR-0061 ruling 2 risk for community overlays; verdict effect not measured)"  # 2fd7
    status: todo_hard  # 2fd7
