  message: "Fixed in PR #1928 (dev d0061769ad). Measured first as the item asked (~/hg_meas/pofal/): on a one-file repo calling an uncatalogued frobnet.post, io-boundaries external_potential_edges was 1 with no overlay and 0 under a community overlay naming frobnet.post in stdlib_other; NO verify-claims verdict moved -- a net_send must_not_exist claim and a host_secret->network taint claim were inconclusive in all three arms (none/community/yours), because the unclassified-module coverage signal is computed apart from the external_potential chains. Fix: load_catalog withholds a community file's stdlib_other with its module_completeness (ADR-0061 ruling 2 table and CATALOGUES.md updated). Behavioral evidence through the production io-boundaries CLI (test_community_overlay_stdlib_other.py::test_the_production_path): external_potential_edges 1 / 1 / 0 for none / community / your own overlay. Mutation-checked."  # a158
